    <!-- Chapter 1: Introduction -->
    <section class="chapter" id="intro">
      <div class="narrow-container">
        <div class="chapter-number">Chapter 1</div>
        <h2 class="chapter-title">A Town at a Crossroads</h2>
        <div class="body-text">
          <p>
            <span class="drop-cap">F</span>or generations, Shore Road has served
            as the vital artery connecting Swanage to its surrounding
            communities. Now, a proposal to permanently close this essential
            route threatens to transform not just traffic patterns, but the very
            fabric of this coastal town.
          </p>

          <p>
            The North Swanage Traffic Concern Group emerged from kitchen table
            conversations and worried whispers in local shops. We are residents,
            business owners, healthcare workers, and concerned citizens united
            by a simple belief: infrastructure decisions should serve the
            community, not fracture it.
          </p>

          <p>
            This investigation reveals the true cost of the Shore Road closure
            proposal through data, testimonies, and careful analysis of what's
            at stake for our town.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Data Viz: Traffic Impact -->
