        </h3>
        <div class="chart-container">
          <div class="bar-chart">
            <div class="bar" style="height: 85%" data-delay="0">
              <span class="bar-value">+340%</span>
              <span class="bar-label">High Street</span>
            </div>
            <div class="bar" style="height: 65%" data-delay="200">
              <span class="bar-value">+260%</span>
              <span class="bar-label">Station Road</span>
            </div>
            <div class="bar" style="height: 75%" data-delay="400">
              <span class="bar-value">+300%</span>
              <span class="bar-label">Victoria Avenue</span>
            </div>
            <div class="bar" style="height: 45%" data-delay="600">
