          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="photo-container">
          <div class="photo-placeholder">
            <div class="photo-label">TIME CRITICAL</div>
          </div>
          <p class="photo-caption">
            Summer congestion: When every second counts, delays cost lives
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="impact-grid">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="impact-card">
          <div class="impact-icon">MEDICAL</div>
          <div class="impact-title">Medical Emergencies</div>
          <div class="impact-text">
            Heart attacks, strokes, and accidents require immediate response.
            Traffic delays can be fatal.
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="impact-card">
          <div class="impact-icon">ELDERLY</div>
          <div class="impact-title">Elderly & Vulnerable</div>
          <div class="impact-text">
            Swanage's aging population depends on reliable emergency access more
            than ever.
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="impact-card">
          <div class="impact-icon">FIRE</div>
          <div class="impact-title">Fire Services</div>
          <div class="impact-text">
            Fire engines and ambulances share the same congested alternative
            routes.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="priority-callout">
      <div class="container">
        <h2 class="priority-title">Public Safety Must Come First</h2>
        <p class="priority-text">
          Infrastructure decisions should protect lives, not endanger them. Any
          plan that affects emergency access MUST involve emergency services
          from day one. The fact that this didn't happen reveals a dangerous
          disregard for public safety.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="action-section">
      <div class="container">
        <h2 style="font-size: 36px; margin-bottom: 30px">
          Demand Emergency Service Consultation
        </h2>
        <p
          style="
            font-family: var(--sans);
            font-size: 18px;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
          "
        >
          Before any Shore Road changes proceed, emergency services MUST be
          properly consulted. Lives depend on it.
        </p>

        <div class="action-buttons">
          <a href="#" class="action-btn" onclick="shareEvidence()"
            >Share This Evidence</a
          >
          <a href="tel:01929555100" class="action-btn">Call the Alliance</a>
          <a href="mailto:action@swanagetraffic.org" class="action-btn"
            >Email Concerns</a
          >
        </div>

        <div class="emergency-contact">
          <h3>Emergency Service Consultation Should Include:</h3>
          <p>
            South West Ambulance Trust • Dorset Fire Service • Air Ambulance
            Routes<br />
            Peak Season Access Plans • Emergency Vehicle Priority Systems
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <script>
      // Intersection Observer for animations
      const observerOptions = {
        threshold: 0.1,
        rootMargin: "0px 0px -50px 0px",
      };

      const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
        entries.forEach((entry) => {
          if (entry.isIntersecting) {
            entry.target.classList.add("visible");
          }
        });
      }, observerOptions);

      // Observe all animatable elements
      document
        .querySelectorAll(".chapter, .photo-container, .impact-card")
        .forEach((el) => {
          observer.observe(el);
        });

      // Parallax effect on emergency icon
      window.addEventListener("scroll", () => {
        const scrolled = window.pageYOffset;
        const icon = document.querySelector(".emergency-icon");
        if (icon && scrolled < window.innerHeight) {
          icon.style.transform = `translateY(${scrolled * 0.3}px)`;
        }
      });

      function shareEvidence() {
        if (navigator.share) {
          navigator.share({
            title: "Emergency Services Left in the Dark - Swanage",
            text: "Council never consulted ambulance services about Shore Road changes!",
            url: window.location.href,
          });
        } else {
          // Fallback to Facebook share
          window.open(
            "https://www.facebook.com/sharer/sharer.php?u=" +
              encodeURIComponent(window.location.href),
            "_blank"
          );
        }
      }
    </script>

    <!-- Visitor Tracking -->
    <script src="/campaigns/tracker.min.js"></script>
